---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Editorial Policy & Reference Standards | Real BMI"
    description="Read our editorial policy for evidence-based health content, peer-reviewed methodology, clinical screening definitions, and transparent user guidance."
    canonicalURL="https://realbmicalculator.com/en/editorial-policy/"
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
      title="Editorial Policy"
      eyebrow="Methodology & Transparency"
      description="How Bhawanshi Dosi researches, references, and maintains evidence-based health tools and educational content."
      returnUrl="/en/"
      returnLabel="Home"
    >
      <div class="max-w-5xl space-y-8 prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-lg font-medium opacity-90">
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-normal text-[var(--foreground)] leading-relaxed">
          Welcome to <strong>Real BMI</strong>. This is an independent health calculation website. It was built and is maintained by <strong>Bhawanshi Dosi</strong> in Banswara, Rajasthan, India. Our goal is simple. We provide clear, scientific calculators for everyday health tracking. You can check your Body Mass Index (BMI), Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR), and daily calories for free. Every tool is private and runs right in your browser.
        </p>

        <!-- 1. Evidence-Based Guidelines & Standards -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            1. Evidence-Based Guidelines & Standards
          </h2>
          <p>
            All health calculators on Real BMI use published medical guidelines and research:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
            <li><strong>World Health Organization (WHO):</strong> We use international adult BMI cutoff points (TRS 854). We also include Asian regional cutoff points (23.0 kg/m² for overweight, 27.5 kg/m² for obesity).</li>
            <li><strong>Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC):</strong> We reference standard population data and pediatric growth percentiles.</li>
            <li><strong>Indian Council of Medical Research (ICMR):</strong> We include consensus cutoff points for South Asian populations.</li>
            <li><strong>Peer-Reviewed Research:</strong> We use published formulas from Mifflin-St Jeor, Devine, Mosteller, Boer, and the U.S. Navy.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Author Identity & Standards -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            2. Author Identity & Standards
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is an independent website with complete personal accountability:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
            <li><strong>Solo Creator:</strong> <strong>Bhawanshi Dosi</strong> writes all code, runs all tests, and reviews all content.</li>
            <li><strong>Complete Privacy:</strong> All calculations run locally on your device. We never store or transmit your personal health numbers.</li>
            <li><strong>Educational Tools:</strong> This site is for educational use only. It is not a hospital or clinic. Our tools offer estimates, not medical diagnoses.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Transparency & Continuous Updates -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            3. Transparency & Continuous Updates
          </h2>
          <p>
            We believe health tools should be open and easy to verify. Every tool page shows its exact math formula and input requirements. We also list clinical limits and link directly to published studies. We do not use hidden algorithms.
          </p>
          <p>
            All 23 tools are offered across six languages. Each version shares the same verified formulas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Editorial Independence & Advertising Ethics -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            4. Editorial Independence & Advertising Ethics
          </h2>
          <p>
            Real BMI is completely free to use. We do not charge fees or require accounts. The site is supported by standard ads from Google AdSense.
          </p>
          <p>
            Advertisers have zero control over our content. They cannot change our formulas, articles, or results. We do not sell sponsored tool results or paid product placements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Educational Disclaimer & Clinical Boundaries -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            5. Educational Disclaimer & Clinical Boundaries
          </h2>
          <p>
            Our calculators provide general estimates. They are made for personal health awareness. They are not medical diagnoses or treatment plans.
          </p>
          <p>
            BMI cannot measure muscle mass, bone density, or individual health history. Always talk with a licensed doctor or dietitian before making health changes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Review Cycle & Automated Testing -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            6. Review Cycle & Automated Testing
          </h2>
          <p>
            We review our formulas twice each year. If public health agencies update their guidelines, we update our calculations to match.
          </p>
          <p>
            We maintain quality with automated code tests. Over 500 tests run before every update. They check math accuracy across metric and US units.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Human Authorship & Originality -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            7. Human Authorship & Originality
          </h2>
          <p>
            All guides, worked examples, and FAQs are written directly by Bhawanshi Dosi. Every piece connects to published medical research.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not publish scraped or automated content. Every paragraph is reviewed for accuracy and plain language.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 8. Corrections Policy & Feedback Protocol -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            8. Corrections Policy & Feedback Protocol
          </h2>
          <p>
            Accuracy is our top priority. If you spot an error or an outdated citation, please let us know. You can reach us on our <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-medium">Contact Page</a>.
          </p>
          <p>
            We review reports quickly. Confirmed fixes are pushed live within 24 to 48 hours.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 9. Pre-Publication Review & Privacy Protocol -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">
            9. Pre-Publication Review & Privacy Protocol
          </h2>
          <p>
            Before any new tool goes live, it must pass four quality checks:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1.5 text-sm sm:text-base">
            <li><strong>1. Source Check:</strong> Formulas are checked against published peer-reviewed journals.</li>
            <li><strong>2. Math Testing:</strong> Automated tests confirm metric and imperial outputs match.</li>
            <li><strong>3. Privacy Check:</strong> We verify that no user data is stored or sent to any server.</li>
            <li><strong>4. Clarity Review:</strong> Formatting, citations, and readability are verified before release.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
